{"Lines 114\u2013115 are dead code \u2014 two ASN1Encoder instances are created, written to, and immediately discarded without their results being used. These lines should be removed.": 0.9523462057113647, "logger.debugf(builder.toString()) passes the string directly as a format pattern. If any provider class name contains a % character, this will throw a java.util.MissingFormatArgumentException. Use logger.debug(builder.toString()) or logger.debugf(\"%s\", builder.toString()) instead.": 0.7159427404403687, "KeyPairGenerator.getInstance(\"EC\").genKeyPair() generates a key pair on the JVM's default EC curve (typically P-256), but testES384() and testES512() need keys generated on matching curves (P-384 for ES384, P-521 for ES512). The tests are not exercising the correct curve for each algorithm.": 0.8987573385238647}